kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "infra-provider"
purpose: "Provider 装配与映射：协议适配实现在 xylitol-ai-bridge；主仓 LlmAdapter/XyModel 外壳与 DTO 映射。"
valid_scope[3]: src/infra/provider/,"packages/xylitol-ai-bridge/",tests/
requirements[10]{req_id,title,statement}:
  pa1,"adapter-trait",System SHALL 在 infra/provider/adapter 定义 LlmAdapter trait，暴露 generate_stream 与 generate 方法，返回 XyStream。
  pa2,"openai-responses-adapter","System SHALL 提供 OpenAiResponsesAdapter，调用 /v1/responses，对 reasoning items 发出 XyChunk::ThinkingDelta，对 message items 发出 XyChunk::TextDelta。"
  pa3,"anthropic-messages-adapter","System SHALL 提供 AnthropicMessagesAdapter，保留现有 Anthropic SSE 解析行为，对 thinking content blocks 发出 XyChunk::ThinkingDelta。"
  pa4,"adapter-selection","System SHALL 基于 XyModelConfig 的 kind 与 api 字段选择具体 adapter：显式可识别 api MUST 优先；省略 api 时 OpenAI 兼容 MUST 默认 openai-responses、Anthropic MUST 默认 anthropic-messages。OpenAI 兼容族可识别 api MUST 仅为 openai-responses；配置值为 openai-completions 或其它未识别字符串时 MUST 静默等同省略（装配 openai-responses），MUST NOT 为此单独报错或告警，MUST NOT 再提供 Chat Completions 适配实现。AdapterKind 选择 MUST NOT 读取 WirePolicy/compat/extra_policy。"
  pa5,"responses-input-items-have-type","OpenAI Responses adapter MUST 序列化每个 input item 并带显式 type 字段，匹配 Responses API schema：message items 为 {type: message, role, content: [{type: input_text|output_text, text}]}，function calls 为 {type: function_call, ...}，function outputs 为 {type: function_call_output, ...}。MUST NOT 发出无 type 的裸 {role, content} 对象：Responses API 在 input array 混入非 message items 时会拒绝 Cannot determine type of 'item'（恰发生在 tool-calling continuation round）。assistant round 仅含 tool call 无 text 时 MUST NOT 发出空 message item（仅 function_call item）。证据：convert_messages_to_input_items 将 message items 建为无 type 的 {role, content}，c375 ReAct-loop fix 后首个真实 tool continuation round 被 OpenAI 以 Cannot determine type of 'item' 拒绝；该函数无测试覆盖。"
  pa6,"单一-XyModel-装配路径","System MUST 通过唯一装配路径将协议适配器暴露为 XyModel：具体接线实现归属 packages/xylitol-ai-bridge，经主仓映射与统一外壳（如 AdapterXyModel）注入；OpenAI 兼容 MUST 仅经 Responses 适配暴露；MUST NOT 在主仓或包内保留 Chat Completions 完整 adapter 实现，MUST NOT 在主仓保留与包并行的第二套完整 adapter 实现。"
  pa7,"vendor-类型不出-infra与agent","async-openai 与各厂商 HTTP/SSE 具体类型 MUST 仅出现在 packages/xylitol-ai-bridge（及其测试）与必要的主仓映射边界内；agent/ MUST NOT import 这些 vendor crate；主仓 infra 若保留映射模块 MUST NOT 把 vendor 类型再导出给 agent。"
  pa20,"agent-projects-before-model","XyModel 端口的消息入参 MUST 为 Vec<AiBridgeMessage>（或等价 LLM DTO），MUST NOT 再接受 AgentMessage。agent 在调用 XyModel 之前 MUST 经 project_for_llm（或等价）完成 Env 折叠；infra provider 装配 MUST NOT 再以 AgentMessage→bridge 孪生映射为主路径。投影 MUST 保留开闭：新环境消息变体的折叠策略落在 agent 投影层，MUST NOT 要求 bridge 同步增加平行 session 角色。"
  pa21,"wire-policy-inject-not-own","主仓 infra 装配路径 MUST 将 xylitol-ai-bridge 的 WirePolicy::default()（或测试注入的等价值）交给 Responses/相关适配消费；MUST NOT 在主仓另建并行默认值真源，MUST NOT 为 compat/extra_policy 新增 YAML/ModelEntry 字段或正式 env 配置面。由装配单测或文档场景覆盖，MUST NOT 为静态缺省单独扩 BDD step。"
  pa22,"api-fullname-full-names","配置与装配中可识别的 api 字面量 MUST 使用全称 openai-responses 与 anthropic-messages；产品文档 MUST NOT 把配置真值简写成 responses 或 messages。省略 api→默认 openai-responses（OpenAI 兼容）行为保持（见 pa4 / m13）。由单测与文档覆盖，MUST NOT 单独扩 BDD step。"
scenarios[5]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  pa7,"no-async-openai-in-agent-unit",agent/ 代码,搜索 async_openai 导入,零匹配,false
  pa7,"no-vendor-leak-unit",agent/ 与 protocol/,搜索 async_openai,零匹配,false
  pa21,"no-yaml-compat-extra-policy-unit","审查 ModelEntry / AppConfig schema","查找 compat 与 extra_policy 字段","MUST NOT 存在用户面 YAML 字段；WirePolicy 默认在 bridge",false
  pa22,"api-omitted-defaults-responses-unit","YAML OpenAI 模型省略 api","resolve AdapterKind","选用 openai-responses（既有行为）",false
  pa4,"stale-completions-api-falls-to-responses-unit","YAML OpenAI 模型 api 为 openai-completions","resolve AdapterKind","选用 openai-responses 且无 Completions 适配实例",false
